abstract: >-
  An offline-reproducible reanalysis of published pull-request metrics,
  repository composition, comment-boundary sensitivity, and public automated
  artifact-size reporting. The included frozen evidence and provenance are
  distinct from the unavailable historical source-study snapshot.
